        "text": "In the separate-execution preview, approval records review only. The original requester must use a separate execution step for a supported action; current authorization, exact proposal and target checks still apply. An AWS ECS request depends on a separately configured tenant-owned workflow. Approval or dispatch acceptance does not verify ECS execution, service health or rollback; each requires independent outcome evidence. The website preview grants no execution authority."
